To add a bit of actual content to this long, mostly-useless thread:
Strange characters may also be caused by an incompatible codepage
setting in Windows.  This old relict from DOS times can be changed
somewhere under Control Panel –> Regional Options (exact spot AFAIK
depends on Windows version).  If you have something else than 437
(English/US) there, that might well be the reason for what you see.

